{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# Workbook diagnostic\nWork down the numbered steps. **The first one that fails identifies the layer at fault.**\n\nReport back which step number breaks and what it shows."
      },
      "name": "d0"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Step 1 — Text rendering\nIf you can read this, text items and the outer JSON envelope are fine."
      },
      "name": "d1"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "print Result = 'Step 2 OK - the workbook can run a query against this workspace'",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Step 2 — bare query, no parameters, no tables",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "d2"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Step 3 — Parameters\nBelow should show **two filled-in pills**: a time range showing 'Last 7 days' and a dropdown showing **15m**. If either is blank, empty, or says 'mandatory', parameter defaults are the problem."
      },
      "name": "d3"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "b8e2cd43-13ac-5ef6-9339-68665842c171",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 604800000
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "46e4ca6b-9db5-564e-ac10-558fa245e0db",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TestWindow",
            "label": "Test dropdown",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": "15m",
            "queryType": 8,
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            },
            "query": "[{\"value\": \"5m\", \"label\": \"5 minutes\"}, {\"value\": \"15m\", \"label\": \"15 minutes\", \"selected\": true}, {\"value\": \"1h\", \"label\": \"1 hour\"}]"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "d3params"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "print Step = 'Step 4', Window = '{TestWindow}', Note = 'If Window shows 15m, parameter substitution works'",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Step 4 — parameter substitution into a query",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "d4"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "union isfuzzy=true (SigninLogs | take 1 | extend T='SigninLogs')\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize Rows = count()\n| extend Note = iff(Rows > 0, 'SigninLogs has data in range', 'SigninLogs EMPTY or not connected - this is a data problem, not a workbook problem')",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Step 5 — time range parameter against a real table",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table"
      },
      "name": "d5"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Step 6 — Tabs\nClick the two tabs below. Each should reveal a line of text.\nIf clicking does nothing, or neither section ever appears, the tab/group mechanism is the problem."
      },
      "name": "d6"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "46ca798f-39ee-5049-b0f6-a990d55b955f",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DiagTab",
            "label": "Selected tab",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "a",
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "d6state"
    },
    {
      "type": 11,
      "content": {
        "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
        "style": "tabs",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": "e9b73c8e-ccaa-5fb5-9a01-56e84964c810",
            "cellValue": "DiagTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Tab A",
            "subTarget": "a",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "15cf0e01-64b1-5295-a536-6efed5b6accc",
            "cellValue": "DiagTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Tab B",
            "subTarget": "b",
            "style": "link"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "d6tabs"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "**Tab A content visible — tabs work.** Tab A is also the default, so this should be showing the moment the workbook loads."
            },
            "name": "d6a-t"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "DiagTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "a"
      },
      "name": "d6a"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "**Tab B content visible — tab switching works.**"
            },
            "name": "d6b-t"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "DiagTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "b"
      },
      "name": "d6b"
    }
  ],
  "isLocked": false,
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json"
}